**Technical Implementation**

SmartFarming was built using:

- Flask Python web framework with Gunicorn WSGI production server
- PostgreSQL database with SQLAlchemy ORM and Alembic migration management
- Flask-Admin administration panel with Flask-Migrate schema versioning
- Multi-provider Gemma 4 AI architecture (cloud, local, and edge inference)
- Google AI Studio cloud inference via google-generativeai SDK
- Ollama-powered local Gemma 4 inference for offline-capable AI reasoning
- MediaPipe LiteRT on-device edge inference for mobile and embedded deployment
- Placeholder rule-based AI fallback for fully offline development scenarios
- Intent classification engine with 9 farm-specific intents (sub-millisecond, no AI calls)
- Multi-agent orchestration architecture (Coordinator, Dashboard, Planning, Risk, Notification, Intelligence agents)
- APScheduler cron-based background intelligence pipelines (daily updates, task generation, weekly planning)
- Climate-aware seasonal planning engine with multi-crop schedule generation
- Dynamic daily task generation service driven by field conditions and weather
- Adaptive weekly plan orchestration with milestone tracking
- Rule engine with 20+ domain rulebooks (compatibility, action, threshold, climate range, timeline)
- Structured prompt composition pipeline with context aggregation and intent-aware fetching
- Streaming chatbot service with multi-turn conversation management and persistence
- DuckDuckGo web search integration for AI response grounding
- Weather data pipeline with anomaly detection and climate risk assessment
- Marshmallow and Pydantic schema validation layers
- Capacitor-based cross-platform mobile wrapper with Android native build
- Jinja2 server-side templating with Tailwind CSS and Bootstrap UI components
- Multi-language translation system (Urdu/English) with i18n JavaScript support
- JSON-structured AI output mode for machine-readable planning responses
- Change history tracking across tasks, weather, and weekly plans
- pytest-based test suite covering chatbot, planning, rule engine, and task services